 y1="60" x2="65" y2="86" stroke="#2a2f3f" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2,2"/><line x1="170" y1="60" x2="175" y2="86" stroke="#c9a04a" stroke-width="1.5"/><line x1="170" y1="60" x2="285" y2="86" stroke="#2a2f3f" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2,2"/><text x="170" y="148" font-size="8" fill="#8892a4" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="normal">全ノードが8080を受け付け、内部で</text><text x="170" y="160" font-size="8" fill="#8892a4" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="normal">実際にタスクが動くノードへ自動転送する</text></svg>')
